{"recordId":"emperor_李安全_281534938","name":"李安全","type":"emperor","dynasty":"遼夏金","title":"盲動覆國","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"夏襄宗","pageId":148630,"revisionId":94691750,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-10-01T15:48:09Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%8F%E8%A5%84%E5%AE%97","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94691750","wikidataId":"Q7456","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"辭海（1999年版缩印本）","url":null,"type":"citation-template","template":"cite book","author":"辞海编辑委员会","publisher":"上海辞书出版社","date":"2000","isbn":"7532608395","locator":"citation template"},{"citationTitle":"《中国民族史人物辞典》","url":null,"type":"citation-template","template":"cite book","author":"","publisher":"中国社会科学出版社","date":"1990年","isbn":"","locator":"citation template"},{"citationTitle":"中国民族史人物辞典","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:37:05.327Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:jinshi","source:yuanshi"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:jinshi-f2de10eff4c6b830","query":"李安全","count":1,"offset":5706,"excerpt":"於汴。己亥，尚書戶部侍郎梁鏜行六部尚書事于山東。辛丑，遣尚書左司郎中溫蒂罕思敬冊李安全為夏國王。甲辰，宋吳曦將馮興、楊雄、李圭等入秦州，陝西都統副使承裕等擊破之，斬楊雄、李珪。\n\n　　冬十月戊申朔，平章政事僕散揆督諸道兵伐宋。庚戌，揆以行省兵三萬","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:jinshi-e95ab05b081f11da","query":"李安全","count":2,"offset":5476,"excerpt":"、吳氏譜牒來上。|| 正月癸未朔，夏武節大夫紐尚德、宣德郎鄭勗賀正旦。\n乙丑，夏李安全廢其主純佑自立，令純佑母羅氏為表，遣御史大夫罔佐執中等來奏求封冊。\n七月戊戌，詔宣問羅氏所以廢立之故，安全復以羅氏表來。\n九月辛丑，以朝議大夫尚書左司郎中溫迪罕","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:yuanshi-94d492ab28186e26","query":"李安全","count":1,"offset":7569,"excerpt":"，滅之。脫脫中流矢死。屈出律奔契丹。\n\n四年己巳春，畏吾兒國來歸。帝入河西。夏主李安全遣其世子率師來戰，敗之，獲其副元帥高令公。克兀剌海城，俘其太傅西壁氏。進至克夷門，復敗夏師，獲其將嵬名令公。薄中興府，引河水灌之。堤決，水外潰，遂撤圍還。遣太傅","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":3,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:jinshi-f2de10eff4c6b830","bookId":"book:jinshi","requestedTitle":"金史/卷12","title":"金史/卷12","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%87%91%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B712","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2432653","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%87%91%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B712?action=history","revisionId":2432653,"revisionTimestamp":"2024-07-05T14:39:08Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:56:08.012Z","sha256":"63760dee5da9fb80c3b906e33240b489c3ab2aad86b8fc397a5011efb3a58e1c","textSha256":"5c689fad73935afcc86def1f92cb2384c3c99eb2ca7798923d1a7c820d018e2f","expandedWikitextSha256":"63760dee5da9fb80c3b906e33240b489c3ab2aad86b8fc397a5011efb3a58e1c","characters":10007,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/jinshi.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:41.135Z","upstreamTextQuality":null,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"not-independently-collated","extractionNotes":[],"expandedTransclusionTitles":[],"transclusionIssues":[],"transclusions":[],"textPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/documents/54e8788c94dace7b4594.json","wikitextPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/wikitext/54e8788c94dace7b4594.json","relatedDocumentIds":[]},{"id":"document:jinshi-e95ab05b081f11da","bookId":"book:jinshi","requestedTitle":"金史/卷62","title":"金史/卷62","sour